{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"气郁 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"气郁","date_published":"2026-07-05T12:56:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-07-05T12:59:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/6-11-qiyu/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/6-11-qiyu/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["气郁"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“气郁”部分，由雷公真君专论郁怒伤肝、气塞不能言的急症治法。核心思想是：郁症伤肝，不可伐肝，伐肝愈助其郁。当大补肝血以平肝气，兼健脾化痰、疏郁利水，使气机舒展，郁解声出。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“气郁”部分，由\u003cstrong\u003e雷公真君\u003c/strong\u003e专论\u003cstrong\u003e郁怒伤肝、气塞不能言\u003c/strong\u003e的急症治法。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e郁症伤肝，不可伐肝，伐肝愈助其郁。当大补肝血以平肝气，兼健脾化痰、疏郁利水，使气机舒展，郁解声出\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}